  "integration_notes": [
    "Add only these explicit new function/table sets to the current DB baseline classifications. Keep legacy-db.json unchanged.",
    "save_content_field is an existing replacement and retains its execution ACL. content_fields already returns the new column through to_jsonb(field_catalog).",
    "All existing and newly registered fields remain off until an explicit authorized registry save. No field is automatically opted in by this migration.",
    "No new roles, grants to accounts, templates, logging system, provider credential lookup or live provider are introduced.",
    "The two existing audit/touch functions are reused and are not new inventory entries."
  ]
